{
  "source": "course-assets/why-learn-ai/why-learn-ai.mp4",
  "duration": 167.2533125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.22,
      "text": "Imagine you are a scribe in the 1450s."
    },
    {
      "start": 3.58,
      "end": 6.18,
      "text": "All day, you hand copy the king's proclamations"
    },
    {
      "start": 6.18,
      "end": 8.06,
      "text": "and send them out across the kingdom."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.48,
      "end": 10.44,
      "text": "It is a reliable, steady job."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.44,
      "end": 14.0,
      "text": "Then one morning, you hear that a guy in mines"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.0,
      "end": 15.3,
      "text": "built a new machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 15.86,
      "end": 18.3,
      "text": "It prints pages a thousand times faster"
    },
    {
      "start": 18.3,
      "end": 19.52,
      "text": "than you can write them by hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 20.08,
      "end": 21.06,
      "text": "You have two choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.54,
      "end": 23.78,
      "text": "You can pretend the new technology isn't happening,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.14,
      "end": 26.72,
      "text": "or you can learn the machine well enough to operate it."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.72,
      "end": 29.94,
      "text": "This board illustrates our modern version of that story."
    },
    {
      "start": 30.74,
      "end": 36.42,
      "text": "AI is the press in this comparison, and learning to use it is today's version of learning to run that new machine."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.22,
      "end": 38.76,
      "text": "Run it, or someone else will."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.92,
      "end": 40.96,
      "text": "You can start now."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.58,
      "end": 46.52,
      "text": "Learn what AI does well, notice where it struggles, and practice using it for something you care about."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.16,
      "end": 49.92,
      "text": "Every project gives you experience you can bring to the next one."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.66,
      "end": 54.42,
      "text": "We have seen tools close the gap between ideas and creation before."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.42,
      "end": 61.48,
      "text": "Before personal computers, becoming a designer meant spending years at a drafting table, learning to draw every line by hand."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.16,
      "end": 63.82,
      "text": "Then, desktop publishing arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 64.46,
      "end": 69.78,
      "text": "Suddenly, a teenager with a personal computer could design posters, magazines, and brochures from their bedroom."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.38,
      "end": 71.74,
      "text": "The tool didn't replace skill."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.18,
      "end": 76.54,
      "text": "Instead, it shortened the distance between wanting to do the work and actually doing it."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.06,
      "end": 80.58,
      "text": "AI gives you a similar chance to start making things while you build your skills."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.58,
      "end": 87.22,
      "text": "This infographic maps out three specific reasons why you'll thrive in the AI future, if you begin learning now."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.84,
      "end": 96.5,
      "text": "First, this is your time. Building skills while you are in school provides a safe environment to try new things, ask questions, and learn from the results."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.2,
      "end": 105.12,
      "text": "Second, you'll move faster. AI helps you try out ideas, get immediate feedback, and tackle projects you otherwise wouldn't know how to start."
    },
    {
      "start": 105.12,
      "end": 108.1,
      "text": "Third, you build good habits early."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.72,
      "end": 113.18,
      "text": "Starting now means you practice asking good questions, checking answers, and making your"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.18,
      "end": 114.52,
      "text": "own independent decisions."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.24,
      "end": 115.7,
      "text": "Start now."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.1,
      "end": 118.54,
      "text": "Build skills you'll carry into whatever comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 119.28,
      "end": 121.64,
      "text": "New tools consistently change how people work."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.26,
      "end": 125.76,
      "text": "The steam engine proved this by replacing human and animal physical labor."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.3,
      "end": 129.84,
      "text": "Electricity followed, accelerating factory production and increasing output."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.84,
      "end": 135.0,
      "text": "The internet then shifted how we process and distribute information across a global network."
    },
    {
      "start": 135.86,
      "end": 137.96,
      "text": "AI could do it across almost everything."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.66,
      "end": 140.96,
      "text": "This scale is recognized at the highest levels."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.34,
      "end": 145.9,
      "text": "In July 2025, the White House released an official national strategy document titled,"
    },
    {
      "start": 146.16,
      "end": 148.66,
      "text": "Winning the Race, America's AI Action Plan."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.18,
      "end": 151.94,
      "text": "The document outlines the scope of this technology clearly."
    },
    {
      "start": 152.34,
      "end": 157.2,
      "text": "An industrial revolution, an information revolution, and a renaissance, all at once."
    },
    {
      "start": 157.2,
      "end": 159.52,
      "text": "This is the potential that AI presents."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.16,
      "end": 161.68,
      "text": "AI is today's printing press."
    },
    {
      "start": 162.3,
      "end": 163.08,
      "text": "Learn to run it."
    }
  ],
